### API Tests for Sammy Agent Backend

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### 1. Create a New Conversation
# @name createConversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My Test Conversation"
}

###

# Extract the ID from the previous request for future requests
@conversationId = {{createConversation.response.body.id}}

### 2. Get All Conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations

###

### 3. Get the Specific Conversation
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}

###

### 4. Send a Message
# Note: This will trigger the Execution Loop!
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hello Sammy, can you check my recent emails?"
}

###

### 5. Get Messages from Conversation
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
